    "body": "Yeah, I think it's clear that as they will behave like eager images.\r\n\r\nWe could add some non-normative text to call out the difference between lazy and load-on-demand.\r\n\r\nAnd https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#images-3 still needs to say to show alt for load-on-demand images that haven't started loading.",
